at_help:
✨ @ shortcuts — conversation context control

Type @ to quickly adjust how the Agent works:
  · Language: make the Agent reply in a language (@lang)
  · Skill: switch focus, coding/writing/analysis/fiction/general (@skill)
  · References: bring file/folder content into context (@file / @folder)

@lang zh|en|ja     switch reply language (current: {lang})
@skill <name>      switch skill (coding/writing/analysis/fiction/general)
@file <path>       add file content to context (≤4000 chars, auto truncated)
@folder <path>     add folder listing to context (≤30 items)
@refs              view current references
@clear             clear file/folder references

Examples: @lang zh · @skill coding · @file README.md
